    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEMO</h2><br>Haunt Monster is game like Plants and Zombies. Play the demo, review the game and share it with your friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ADD TO WISHLIST</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961960/extras/7101927cf721c465a4ee747f2e08eb89.poster.avif?t=1720134726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961960/extras/7101927cf721c465a4ee747f2e08eb89.webm?t=1720134726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961960/extras/7101927cf721c465a4ee747f2e08eb89.mp4?t=1720134726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Haunt Monster Demo contanins: 2 maps, 3 objects and 4 weapons.<br>Haunt Monster Full Version contanins: 12 maps, 15 objects and 21 weapons + Online Co-op.<br><br>NOTE: Online Co-op is a free gift. If you get any bugs. Please don't give negative reviews. You can report bugs. Thank you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><br>Proxima Army: Eagle Lord is the owner of this army. The strength of the Proxima army is its ability to fight fast and strong.<br><br>Protostar Army: Lizard Lord is the owner of this army. The strength of the Protostar army is its technological intelligence.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOW TO PLAY</h2><br>Press WSAD to move the character. Press B to build. Press F to turn on the flash.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DESCRIPTION</h2><br>Haunt Monster is a FPS Action Roguelike game in a random generated environment. Build, defend and survive waves of zombies, monsters and aliens. Play solo or co-op with a friend to survive. <br><br><strong>BUILD</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961960/extras/d9f28c32d5e238b29aac5f8452e5851e.avif?t=1720134726\" /></div><br>Make money, build bases to protect the army camp. Build machines such as: Assault Machine, Bomb Machine, Medical Machine. Buy weapons and defend against attacks from zombies, monsters and aliens.<br><br><strong>DEFEND</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961960/extras/fb9c36e00b5277969f269c1a3e9299e9.avif?t=1720134726\" /></div><br>Map defenses are random generated. Explore various randomly generated environmental infected areas: forest, desert, arctic. Cooperate with a friend and shoot various zombies, monsters and aliens.<br><br><strong>SURVIOR</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961960/extras/0e55261cffdd42a710ddf5b8778985c4.avif?t=1720134726\" /></div><br>Protect, survive and buy new weapons to defend against attacks from zombies, monsters and aliens. Build more fences, traps, machines with a friend to strengthen your defense. The battle has begun and they are coming.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play alone or co-op with a friend<br></li><li>Build machines to survive<br></li><li>Randomly generated environment<br></li><li>New zombies, monsters and aliens<br></li><li>+12 maps to explore<br></li><li>+15 objects to build defend<br></li><li>+21 weapons in the shop</li></ul>",
